<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:42:27 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7c945fe9a7d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;航海暮光笼罩着大海和海滩。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Nautical twilight engulfs the sea and beach. The sun has set and leaves behind some colour over the sea, but the sky is already darkening from above, making the few clouds seem brighter. Rocks can be seen in the bottom right of the picture." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a7c945fe9a7d.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:42:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7c93a7862a8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;夕阳西下，海滩上潮水渐涨。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The sun is setting at the beach over a rising tide. Most of the photo is of the sea, which is rippling on to the beach. The sun is almost set and is reflected in the sea. The sky is a wash of orange." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a7c93a7862a8.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:39:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7c9156db13f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;太阳在急速上涨的潮汐上方缓缓落下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The sun is setting  over a rising tide. The sun is at the right of the picture and is reflecting into the water, which covers the lower half of the photo. The sky is a mix of sunset colours." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a7c9156db13f.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:29:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7c9017f25b6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;夕阳西下，海滩上潮水渐涨。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The sun is setting at the beach over a rising tide. Most of the photo is of the sky, which is criss crossed with wisps of cloud and contrails. The sun sets at the bottom right, over a group of rocks. The sand can be seen in the foreground and the incoming water beyond that." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a7c9017f25b6.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:24:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7c8f116c49a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只花园蜗牛被我从不锈钢浇水壶里救出来后，趴在车前草叶子上，看起来丝毫未受那趟惊险水滑梯之旅的影响。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A garden snail on a plantain leaf after being rescued from my watering can, exploring their change of environment eagerly." height="3120" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a7c8f116c49a.jpg" width="4208"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:19:53 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>